{{cs-noun|n}}

# [[ear]]
#: {{uxi|cs|[[v|V ]] '''uších''' [[se]] [[jí]] [[třpytily]] [[briliantový|briliantové]] [[náušnice]].|Brilliant earrings glittered at her '''ears'''.}}
